===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# A form of [[government]] in which the [[govern]]ing body has [[absolute]], or almost [[absolute]], control. Typically this control is maintained by [[force]], and little [[pay heed|heed is paid]] to [[public]] [[opinion]] or the [[judicial]] system.

